WEBVTT

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.230
No... Please stop.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:56.400
Please stop. Please!

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:59.150
No!

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:01.440
Please... stop!

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.400
No!

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:33.520
Sir?

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:45.690
BONDED ZERO

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:47.440
DRIFT

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.240
Good morning.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:52.990
Hey, good morning, Zero.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:56.660
Sir, what's going on? It's still morning.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.870
Zero, people are creatures that wake up
in the morning and sleep at night.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:05.250
I never imagined I'd hear common sense
out of your mouth, sir.

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:07.170
Is the world about to end?

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.550
I just woke up, that's all.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:12.880
Don't startle me like that!

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:17.600
I'll go prepare some breakfast then.

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:20.020
Don't worry about me.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.930
What? You're not going to eat?

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:25.060
Yeah, I've got minor business
to take care of.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.770
See you later.

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:31.740
You're really not going to eat breakfast?

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:34.450
Nope. Well, see you later!

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.200
Sir!

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:40.830
Master's not going to eat breakfast?

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.870
It has to be an omen of an apocalypse!

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:52.590
SHU

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:03.390
There's something wrong!

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:07.560
Master never wakes up early.
Voluntarily too!

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:10.400
I don't think you need
to be that concerned.

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:12.440
Didn't he leave to take care of something?

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.570
It's gotta be a lie.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:17.280
He really doesn't wake up in the morning?

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:21.120
He doesn't wake up even if I drop water on
his face or squeeze a lemon on his face.

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:23.370
Why can't you wake him up
like a normal person?

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:25.500
He didn't tell you where he was going?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.460
He just said "minor business."

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:31.590
If a man doesn't tell you where
he's going, he's up to something naughty.

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.220
-I'll throw this one next.
-I'm bleeding!

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.470
-You can't do that Zero, he'll die!
-It's not stopping!

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:38.550
He'll really die!

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.430
It certainly is a bit strange.

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:45.520
I suspect there's something unique
about this minor business.

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:47.480
Unique?

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.110
He woke up voluntarily,

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:55.070
doesn't eat breakfast, leaves in a hurry,
a strange symbol on the calendar...

00:05:55.740 --> 00:06:00.070
If there's that much circumstantial
evidence, it has to be one thing!

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.620
Yes! It feels familiar to me too.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:06.450
Stop! I don't want to hear it, Daddy.

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:09.580
Every working adult has experienced it.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:12.500
Stop! Men are all filthy beasts!

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.500
-It's...
-Stop!

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:15.630
-Golf!
-A lover!

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:19.470
-Jeez! You're unbelievable!
-I'm bleeding! I'm bleeding!

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:20.590
The calendar...

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.010
-Oh, yeah, that's right.
-What?

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.770
There was something written
on the calendar.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:27.810
What did it say?

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:31.730
This symbol.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.940
Could it be something
related to Mr. Shuin?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.190
Shuin?

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:41.110
Zero, have you met Mr. Shuin before?

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:46.200
I haven't. By the time I met Master,
he was already gone.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.000
How did you meet Mr. Inyo?

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.220
Master and I...

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:06.510
Unit Zero! Capture him.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:14.020
Do it. What are you waiting for?

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:15.980
Do you want to be punished again?

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:19.110
Yes, Master.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:37.420
Hopeless eyes...

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:47.140
-Smile.
-What?

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:48.310
Don't worry.

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:50.980
I'm here because someone sent me.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:54.060
They wanted me to find you
and protect you.

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:06.570
Zero?

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:08.120
He flirted with me.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:09.410
What?

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.160
It all started when he hit on me.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.710
What?

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.670
-What do you mean?
-He hit on you?

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:18.290
That can't be...

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:21.760
-I knew it! I knew he was a playboy!
-What?

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:24.760
<i>-I knew something wasn't right.</i>
<i>-It can't be!</i>

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:27.180
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.600
You've grown, Unit Zero.

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:32.270
What?

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:34.940
Leave if you're going to cause a scene.

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:38.900
Tabu?

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.230
What? Do you know him?

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:43.650
Go.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.190
All right.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.400
You should go back to the human world.

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:12.030
IN

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:16.830
Will we meet again?

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:21.130
We'll probably never meet again.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.210
Don't forget about our promise, Yo.

00:10:34.180 --> 00:10:36.100
If you meet her...

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:38.890
protect her, always.

00:11:02.670 --> 00:11:04.420
<i>He forced an assignment onto me.</i>

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:12.470
<i>I don't ever recall saying that</i>
<i>I wanted to become an Angler.</i>

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:29.070
I'm back!

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.740
Sir! You're back!

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:49.960
It's been four years...

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:53.430
In, I'll see you next year.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:59.020
Now, Zero must be getting
worried right about now.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:26.000
Welcome back, Unit Zero.
It's been a while.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:30.300
Easy now. Why don't you turn around?

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:35.800
You can't play games with me.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:37.800
Please leave!

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:40.970
What did you just say, Unit Zero?

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.270
That's my master's seat!

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:10.250
You must be wondering why I suddenly
appeared out of nowhere.

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:14.300
I told you to leave! That's not your seat!

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:19.300
You seem to be misunderstanding something.

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:23.560
Your master is not Inyo, the Angler.

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:25.810
I'm your master!

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:28.730
I'm your one and only master.

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:32.320
Four years ago and now!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:49.420
So you remember.
Feeling a rush of nostalgia?

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.960
Well, this is the latest,
upgraded version.

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:56.920
Why don't you put it on,
just like old times.

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.300
I won't be your guinea pig again.

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.600
Figured you'd say that.

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:04.890
What?

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:10.770
Perhaps you'll change your mind
after you see this.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:12.770
DEN-DEN'S HARDWARE STORE

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:17.610
That's...

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:19.490
Oh, no...

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:22.530
This month's looking bleak.

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.540
What are you planning to do?

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:34.050
-Well, that's all up to you.
-What?

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:42.180
<i>Must be another shoplifter. All right.</i>

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:45.260
Sir, can I help you find anything?

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:52.560
Please leave if you're just browsing.
You'll distract the other customers.

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:54.730
<i>Even though the store's dead.</i>

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.240
-Stop...
-What?

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.320
-Stop it!
-So what do you say?

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:04.280
Do you promise to come back?

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.870
That... That's...

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.370
You're running out of time here.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:13.080
-<i>What's he saying?</i>
-Stop...

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:16.170
<i>-If you're sick, go to the hospital.</i>
-Please stop... Stop...

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:20.550
Stop it! If you hurt him,
I won't let you get away with it!

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:24.720
Like I said,
it all depends on your answer.

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:26.100
You coward!

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:28.430
-Hey, answer me!
-Stop...

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.890
-If you don't leave, I'll call the cops!
-Stop...

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:31.890
-You hear me?
-Stop...

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:33.900
Time's up.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:36.860
-Hey! What's--
-Stop it!

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.080
Now, Unit Zero...

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:59.550
who's your master? Inyo the Angler or I?

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:02.720
Unit Zero!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:06.430
You still don't seem to understand.

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.110
What happened?

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:21.610
What the...?

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.120
Thank you for your patience.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.630
I'll ask you again.

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:44.260
Who's your master?

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:47.640
Inyo or I?

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:00.150
You're my master.

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:04.700
Very well.

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:19.960
I'm back!

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:25.260
<i>It's been four years,</i>
<i>isn't that right, Inyo?</i>

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:28.590
<i>Do you remember me?</i>

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:33.140
Hey, kid! How did you get in?

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:36.980
How did you tame that monster?

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:40.770
Get out! Don't disrupt my experiment!

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:43.690
<i>Apologies for the mess and...</i>

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:47.150
<i>for taking Unit Zero away from you</i>
<i>without permission.</i>

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:01.090
What are you waiting for?

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.800
Do you want to be shocked again?

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:09.970
<i>If living is this painful,</i>

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:15.430
<i>I'd rather be killed by</i>
<i>that monster to set me free.</i>

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:21.110
What's all this noise--

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:29.240
<i>Sorry, In...</i>

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:34.160
<i>This may be the end of me.</i>
<i>I couldn't fulfill the assignment.</i>

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:42.500
<i>Not to worry. Unit Zero is safe. Oh, yes.</i>

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.920
<i>Let's take a look at the others, shall we?</i>

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:50.550
Please move out of the way.
You're disrupting traffic!

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:54.350
I know you can hear me. Enough already!

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:01.310
Yes, how may I help you?

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:05.270
But Daddy, that's not
very cost-effective...

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:07.070
But look...

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:11.860
Who are you? You can't come in here!

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.120
What do you think you're doing?

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:21.540
<i>This is just a warm-up.</i>

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.960
-A warm-up?
<i>-Yes...</i>

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:27.250
<i>for my revenge against you.</i>

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:34.050
What are you all fussing about?
You should admire this monster.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:40.520
Creatures from Magmell possess an instinct
to obey those who are stronger than them.

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:44.360
Instinct? Don't feed me
any of that nonsense.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:47.480
Unit Zero, capture him!

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:51.360
Do it! What are you waiting for?

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:53.610
Do you want to get punished again?

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:05.130
He's a Lachter.

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:08.630
Those who can't treat others
like they're human...

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:11.760
can't be considered human themselves.

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:24.230
Come on, this is ridiculous.

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:36.070
<i>I told you this was just a warm-up.</i>

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.210
<i>I'll be waiting for you, Inyo...</i>

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:51.760
<i>At the place where you stole</i>
<i>everything from me.</i>

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:55.760
<i>If you can actually get there, that is.</i>

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:16.660
Go.

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:11.980
PREVIEW

00:23:12.060 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>-It's been a long time.</i>
<i>-I want to go home...</i>

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:16.820
<i>-Doesn't it feel like home?</i>
<i>-I want to go home, sir!</i>

00:23:16.900 --> 00:23:18.740
<i>That's no good, Unit Zero.</i>

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:21.780
<i>-My strength...</i>
<i>-I hope you aren't</i>

00:23:21.860 --> 00:23:24.700
-<i>thinking of escaping out of here.</i>
<i>-Sir...</i>

00:23:24.780 --> 00:23:25.660
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:27.910
<i>Let me show you something.</i>

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:30.410
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:23:30.500 --> 00:23:33.290
<i>It's unfortunate for you</i>
<i>that I'm still alive.</i>

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:36.380
<i>Do it.</i>

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:37.880
<i>No!</i>

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:39.760
<i>Next time, "Despair."</i>

00:23:39.840 --> 00:23:41.840
Subtitle translation by Sachiko Takahashi
